{"suttaId":"thi-ap21","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[8481,8644],"vripara":"1"},"segments":{"thi-ap21:0.3":"Kuṇḍalakesātherīapadānaṃ","thi-ap21:1.1":"“Padumuttaro nāma jino, sabbadhammāna pāragū;","thi-ap21:1.3":"Ito satasahassamhi, kappe uppajji nāyako.","thi-ap21:2.1":"“Tadāhaṃ haṃsavatiyaṃ, jātā seṭṭhikule ahuṃ;","thi-ap21:2.3":"Nānāratanapajjote, mahāsukhasamappitā.","thi-ap21:3.1":"“Upetvā taṃ mahāvīraṃ, assosiṃ dhammadesanaṃ;","thi-ap21:3.3":"Tato jātappasādāhaṃ, upesiṃ saraṇaṃ jinaṃ.","thi-ap21:4.1":"“Tadā mahākāruṇiko, padumuttaranāmako;","thi-ap21:4.3":"Khippābhiññānamagganti, ṭhapesi bhikkhuniṃ subhaṃ.","thi-ap21:5.1":"“Taṃ sutvā muditā hutvā, dānaṃ datvā mahesino;","thi-ap21:5.3":"Nipacca sirasā pāde, taṃ ṭhānamabhipatthayiṃ.","thi-ap21:6.1":"“Anumodi mahāvīro,‘bhadde yaṃ tebhipatthitaṃ;","thi-ap21:6.3":"Samijjhissati taṃ sabbaṃ, sukhinī hohi nibbutā.","thi-ap21:7.1":"“‘Satasahassito kappe, okkākakulasambhavo;","thi-ap21:7.3":"Gotamo nāma gottena, satthā loke bhavissati.","thi-ap21:8.1":"“‘Tassa dhammesu dāyādā, orasā dhammanimmitā;","thi-ap21:8.3":"Bhaddākuṇḍalakesāti, hessati satthu sāvikā’.","thi-ap21:9.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","thi-ap21:9.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","thi-ap21:10.1":"“Tato cutā yāmamagaṃ, tatohaṃ tusitaṃ gatā;","thi-ap21:10.3":"Tato ca nimmānaratiṃ, vasavattipuraṃ tato.","thi-ap21:11.1":"“Yattha yatthūpapajjāmi, tassa kammassa vāhasā;","thi-ap21:11.3":"Tattha tattheva rājūnaṃ, mahesittamakārayiṃ.","thi-ap21:12.1":"“Tato cutā manussesu, rājūnaṃ cakkavattinaṃ;","thi-ap21:12.3":"Maṇḍalīnañca rājūnaṃ, mahesittamakārayiṃ.","thi-ap21:13.1":"“Sampattiṃ anubhotvāna, devesu mānusesu ca;","thi-ap21:13.3":"Sabbattha sukhitā hutvā, nekakappesu saṃsariṃ.","thi-ap21:14.1":"“Imamhi bhaddake kappe, brahmabandhu mahāyaso;","thi-ap21:14.3":"Kassapo nāma gottena, uppajji vadataṃ varo.","thi-ap21:15.1":"“Upaṭṭhāko mahesissa, tadā āsi narissaro;","thi-ap21:15.3":"Kāsirājā kikī nāma, bārāṇasipuruttame.","thi-ap21:16.1":"“Tassa dhītā catutthāsiṃ, bhikkhudāyīti vissutā;","thi-ap21:16.3":"Dhammaṃ sutvā jinaggassa, pabbajjaṃ samarocayiṃ.","thi-ap21:17.1":"“Anujāni na no tāto, agāreva tadā mayaṃ;","thi-ap21:17.3":"Vīsavassasahassāni, vicarimha atanditā.","thi-ap21:18.1":"“Komāribrahmacariyaṃ, rājakaññā sukhedhitā;","thi-ap21:18.3":"Buddhopaṭṭhānaniratā, muditā satta dhītaro.","thi-ap21:19.1":"“Samaṇī samaṇaguttā ca, bhikkhunī bhikkhudāyikā;","thi-ap21:19.3":"Dhammā ceva sudhammā ca, sattamī saṅghadāyikā.","thi-ap21:20.1":"“Khemā uppalavaṇṇā ca, paṭācārā ahaṃ tadā;","thi-ap21:20.3":"Kisāgotamī dhammadinnā, visākhā hoti sattamī.","thi-ap21:21.1":"“Tehi kammehi sukatehi, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","thi-ap21:21.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","thi-ap21:22.1":"“Pacchime ca bhave dāni, giribbajapuruttame;","thi-ap21:22.3":"Jātā seṭṭhikule phīte, yadāhaṃ yobbane ṭhitā.","thi-ap21:23.1":"“Coraṃ vadhatthaṃ nīyantaṃ, disvā rattā tahiṃ ahaṃ;","thi-ap21:23.3":"Pitā me taṃ sahassena, mocayitvā vadhā tato.","thi-ap21:24.1":"“Adāsi tassa maṃ tāto, viditvāna manaṃ mama;","thi-ap21:24.3":"Tassāhamāsiṃ visaṭṭhā, atīva dayitā hitā.","thi-ap21:25.1":"“So me bhūsanalobhena, balimajjhāsayo [khalitajjhāsayo (sī.), baliṃ paccāharaṃ (syā.), mālapacchāhataṃ (pī.)] diso;","thi-ap21:25.3":"Corappapātaṃ netvāna, pabbataṃ cetayī vadhaṃ.","thi-ap21:26.1":"“Tadāhaṃ paṇamitvāna, sattukaṃ sukatañjalī;","thi-ap21:26.3":"Rakkhantī attano pāṇaṃ, idaṃ vacanamabraviṃ.","thi-ap21:27.1":"“‘Idaṃ suvaṇṇakeyūraṃ, muttā veḷuriyā bahū;","thi-ap21:27.3":"Sabbaṃ harassu [varassu (ka.)] bhaddante, mañca dāsīti sāvaya’.","thi-ap21:28.1":"“‘Oropayassu kalyāṇī, mā bāḷhaṃ paridevasi;","thi-ap21:28.3":"Na cāhaṃ abhijānāmi, ahantvā dhanamābhataṃ’.","thi-ap21:29.1":"“‘Yato sarāmi attānaṃ, yato pattosmi viññutaṃ;","thi-ap21:29.3":"Na cāhaṃ abhijānāmi, aññaṃ piyataraṃ tayā’.","thi-ap21:30.1":"“‘Ehi taṃ upagūhissaṃ, katvāna taṃ padakkhiṇaṃ;","thi-ap21:30.3":"Na ca dāni puno atthi [taṃ vandāmi puna natthi (syā.)], mama tuyhañca saṅgamo.","thi-ap21:31.1":"“‘Na hi sabbesu ṭhānesu, puriso hoti paṇḍito;","thi-ap21:31.3":"Itthīpi paṇḍitā hoti, tattha tattha vicakkhaṇā.","thi-ap21:32.1":"“‘Na hi sabbesu ṭhānesu, puriso hoti paṇḍito;","thi-ap21:32.3":"Itthīpi paṇḍitā hoti, lahuṃ atthavicintikā.","thi-ap21:33.1":"“‘Lahuñca vata khippañca, nikaṭṭhe [nekatthe (sī. syā.)] samacetayiṃ;","thi-ap21:33.3":"Migaṃ uṇṇā yathā evaṃ [cittapuṇṇāya tāneva (syā.), migaṃ puṇṇāya teneva (pī.)], tadāhaṃ sattukaṃ vadhiṃ.","thi-ap21:34.1":"“‘Yo ca uppatitaṃ atthaṃ, na khippamanubujjhati;","thi-ap21:34.3":"So haññate mandamati, corova girigabbhare.","thi-ap21:35.1":"“‘Yo ca uppatitaṃ atthaṃ, khippameva nibodhati;","thi-ap21:35.3":"Muccate sattusambādhā, tadāhaṃ sattukā yathā’.","thi-ap21:36.1":"“Tadāhaṃ pātayitvāna, giriduggamhi sattukaṃ;","thi-ap21:36.3":"Santikaṃ setavatthānaṃ, upetvā pabbajiṃ ahaṃ.","thi-ap21:37.1":"“Saṇḍāsena ca kese me, luñcitvā sabbaso tadā;","thi-ap21:37.3":"Pabbajitvāna samayaṃ, ācikkhiṃsu nirantaraṃ.","thi-ap21:38.1":"“Tato taṃ uggahetvāhaṃ, nisīditvāna ekikā;","thi-ap21:38.3":"Samayaṃ taṃ vicintesiṃ, suvāno mānusaṃ karaṃ.","thi-ap21:39.1":"“Chinnaṃ gayha samīpe me, pātayitvā apakkami;","thi-ap21:39.3":"Disvā nimittamalabhiṃ, hatthaṃ taṃ puḷavākulaṃ.","thi-ap21:40.1":"“Tato uṭṭhāya saṃviggā, apucchiṃ sahadhammike;","thi-ap21:40.3":"Te avocuṃ vijānanti, taṃ atthaṃ sakyabhikkhavo.","thi-ap21:41.1":"“Sāhaṃ tamatthaṃ pucchissaṃ, upetvā buddhasāvake;","thi-ap21:41.3":"Te mamādāya gacchiṃsu, buddhaseṭṭhassa santikaṃ.","thi-ap21:42.1":"“So me dhammamadesesi, khandhāyatanadhātuyo;","thi-ap21:42.3":"Asubhāniccadukkhāti, anattāti ca nāyako.","thi-ap21:43.1":"“Tassa dhammaṃ suṇitvāhaṃ, dhammacakkhuṃ visodhayiṃ;","thi-ap21:43.3":"Tato viññātasaddhammā, pabbajjaṃ upasampadaṃ.","thi-ap21:44.1":"“Āyācito tadā āha,‘ehi bhadde’ti nāyako;","thi-ap21:44.3":"Tadāhaṃ upasampannā, parittaṃ toyamaddasaṃ.","thi-ap21:45.1":"“Pādapakkhālanenāhaṃ, ñatvā saudayabbayaṃ;","thi-ap21:45.3":"Tathā sabbepi saṅkhāre, īdisaṃ cintayiṃ [saṅkhārā, iti saṃcintayiṃ (sī. syā. pī.)] tadā.","thi-ap21:46.1":"“Tato cittaṃ vimucci me, anupādāya sabbaso;","thi-ap21:46.3":"Khippābhiññānamaggaṃ me, tadā paññāpayī jino.","thi-ap21:47.1":"“Iddhīsu ca vasī homi, dibbāya sotadhātuyā;","thi-ap21:47.3":"Paracittāni jānāmi, satthusāsanakārikā.","thi-ap21:48.1":"“Pubbenivāsaṃ jānāmi, dibbacakkhu visodhitaṃ;","thi-ap21:48.3":"Khepetvā āsave sabbe, visuddhāsiṃ sunimmalā.","thi-ap21:49.1":"“Pariciṇṇo mayā satthā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ;","thi-ap21:49.3":"Ohito garuko bhāro, bhavanetti samūhatā.","thi-ap21:50.1":"“Yassatthāya pabbajitā, agārasmānagāriyaṃ;","thi-ap21:50.3":"So me attho anuppatto, sabbasaṃyojanakkhayo.","thi-ap21:51.1":"“Atthadhammaniruttīsu, paṭibhāne tatheva ca;","thi-ap21:51.3":"Ñāṇaṃ me vimalaṃ suddhaṃ, buddhaseṭṭhassa sāsane.","thi-ap21:52.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ, bhavā sabbe samūhatā;","thi-ap21:52.3":"Nāgīva bandhanaṃ chetvā, viharāmi anāsavā.","thi-ap21:53.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi, mama buddhassa santike;","thi-ap21:53.3":"Tisso vijjā anuppattā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap21:54.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso, vimokkhāpi ca aṭṭhime;","thi-ap21:54.3":"Chaḷabhiññā sacchikatā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","thi-ap21:55.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ bhaddākuṇḍalakesā bhikkhunī imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap21:56.1":"Kuṇḍalakesātheriyāpadānaṃ paṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
